# It is 68 MB of stale HTML and duplicated assets and it has never been in the
# repository — `public/` was gitignored. It stays on disk because it is the
# only record of the URL set the old site served, but it is not tracked here
# either: the URL list itself is preserved in `static/*.html` (the redirect
# stubs) and in `_gen_redirects.py`.
